# Vendored / upstream emulator runtimes — JS *and* JSON. Prettier is usually
# semantic-safe, but beautifying these broke EmulatorJS at runtime (the
# "Download Game Core" stall), so every third-party engine file stays exactly
# as shipped. Our own code (prompt/**, systems/**/genx-*.js) and our game
# manifests (systems/<sys>/games.json) are still formatted.
systems/**/*.js
systems/**/*.json
!systems/**/genx-*.js
!systems/*/games.json
